        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Military operations: Operation Strangle, a ground assault operation\n- People: Dave Schreiner\n- Events: World War II, the conflict in which Dave Schreiner was mortally wounded\n\nFacts:\n- Operation Strangle was a World War II airstrike campaign.\n- A later operation was successful because of the airstrikes of Operation Strangle.\n- The ground assault of that later operation occurred six weeks before the conflict in which Dave Schreiner was mortally wounded.",
